<title>USA: GOLF-LEADING SCORES FROM QUAD CITY CLASSIC.</title>
<headline>GOLF-LEADING SCORES FROM QUAD CITY CLASSIC.</headline>
<dateline>COAL VALLEY, Illinois 1996-09-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scores</p>
<p>after three rounds of the $1.2 million Quad City Classic at</p>
<p>Oakwood Country Club on Saturday (U.S. unless noted):</p>
<p>200 Tiger Woods 69 64 67</p>
<p>201 Ed Fiori 66 68 67</p>
<p>203 Steve Jones 68 68 67, Jay Delsing 68 68 67</p>
<p>204 Hugh Royer III 71 68 65</p>
<p>205 Phil Blackmar 69 71 65, Chris Perry 68 70 67, Greg Kraft</p>
<p>68 70 67, Joel Edwards 68 67 70</p>
<p>206 Mike Springer 69 72 65, Brian Tennyson 72 67 67, Allen</p>
<p>Doyle 70 67 69</p>
<p>207 David Toma 72 69 66, Jim McGovern 68 72 67, Leonard</p>
<p>Thompson 69 71 67, John Inman 70 69 68, Kelly Gibson 70 69 68,</p>
<p>Jeff Sluman 69 69 69, Taylor Smith 67 69 71, Mike Standly 68</p>
<p>68 71</p>
